// self-hosted::main_bootstrap — Bootstrap entry point (Stage 1)
//
// Trimmed version of main.sio for the 3-stage bootstrap process.
// Only supports: lex, parse, resolve, check, help, version.
// IR lowering, native codegen, multi-module, and test runners are
// stripped to avoid pulling in the IR/native/compiler layers.

// ============================================================================
// TOKEN KIND NAME PRINTER
// ============================================================================

